{"CommitteeCode":"J12","FullName":"Joint Committee on Economic Development and Emerging Technologies","ShortName":"Economic Development and Emerging Technologies (J)","Description":"It shall be the duty of the committee on Economic Development and Emerging Technologies to consider all matters concerning commercial and industrial establishments, casino gambling and gaming, industrial development, the racing industry, science and technology, economic development, retention of science or technology-intensive industries; adoption of existing industries; innovation systems from research to development; computers; information, networking, the Internet, data storage and access; communication; biotechnology; stem cell research medical technology; medical devices; environmental technologies, classroom applications; workforce technology training and development, etc., and such other matters as may be referred. ","Branch":"Joint","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"SenateChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"BRF0","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0"},"HouseChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"JAP1","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAP1"},"DocumentsBeforeCommittee":[{"BillNumber":"H416","DocketNumber":"HD2761","Title":"An Act to improve the economy of the commonwealth","PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MPK1","Name":"Michael P. Kushmerek","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MPK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:07:25.7066667"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MPK1","Name":"Michael P. Kushmerek","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MPK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:07:25.7066667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H416","IsDocketBookOnly":false}],"ReportedOutDocuments":[{"BillNumber":"S224","DocketNumber":"SD13